  "body": "Be impressed by this brand-new, architecturally designed residence, thoughtfully crafted with a strong emphasis on space, natural light, and high-end finishes throughout.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor showcases an expansive open-plan kitchen complemented by a formal lounge, creating the perfect setting for both everyday living and elegant entertaining. The dining area flows seamlessly to a sun-soaked entertainer’s deck, ideal for summer gatherings. This level also features a full bathroom, a second living area, and internal access garaging for added convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you’ll find four generously sized bedrooms, two beautifully appointed bathrooms (including the master en-suite), and a dedicated study nook — perfect for working from home or focused study time.\r\n\r\nEvery detail has been carefully considered, from premium fittings and solid, enduring construction to elegant rounded corners and designer lighting. This exceptional level of craftsmanship is rarely found in today’s market, ensuring your home remains timeless, desirable, and future-ready with its integrated smart home system.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Smart home system with CCTV security\r\n\r\n• Double glazing and full insulation\r\n\r\n• Bosch appliances including 5 Burner gas cooktop\r\n\r\n• Central air-conditioning servicing both levels\r\n\r\n• Double Westlake High School Zone\r\n\r\nThis stunning home is ideal for professionals, downsizers, or families seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle in one of the North Shore’s most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the ultimate convenience with Milford Village, boutique shops, top school zones, North Shore Hospital, Smales Farm, and the sparkling sands of Milford Beach all just moments from your doorstep.\r\n\r\nCome and discover which of these exceptional homes is the perfect match for your future. Don’t miss this rare opportunity to secure a high-quality smart home in a premium Milford location.",
